   "value": "<p><em>Faceless God — Innate Technique (11th level)</em></p><p>At 11th level, you can spend 6 cursed energy as an action to target a creature within 30 feet that you can see and is currently afflicted by your madness. The target must make an Intelligence saving throw or take 1d10 psychic damage per 10% <em>Mental Corruption</em> they currently have. <br />\n A creature with more than 50% <em>Mental Corruption</em> makes this save with disadvantage.  </p>",
